<!--
  AS-008 (OPC 10000-3 section 4.6.1, 7.13) - PASS case 1.

  "Each Variable and each Object shall be the SourceNode of exactly one
   HasTypeDefinition Reference."

  The ordinary, correct shape of an address space: one ObjectType, one Object
  instantiating it, and one Variable typed as a BaseDataVariableType. Each
  instance node carries exactly one HasTypeDefinition Reference.
-->
<UANodeSet xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
           xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema"
           xmlns="http://opcfoundation.org/UA/2011/03/UANodeSet.xsd">
